  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2018 Yokohama, the first tournament of the 2018 season, was held at Pacifico Yokohama on 3 September 2017. Its top finishers earned Championship Points toward the World Championships and the season's rewards. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth. Its participants got Tapu Koko 127/SM-P with the Champions League 2018 logo."
  },
